very prone to making stuff up. So he didn't sort of steer away from indulging his artistic license. So you have, in several examples, he purified the buildings he was painting. Like adding a story to a building here, adding some decoration there, maybe changing the number of windows in a building, all sorts of little things that made the paintings
非常喜欢凭空捏造。所以他毫不避讳地放飞自己的艺术想象力。因此在几个例子中，你都可以看到他美化了自己正在绘制的建筑。比如给一栋建筑加盖一层，在那里添加一些装饰，或者可能改变一栋建筑的窗户数量，所有这些小细节都让这些画作

